    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_i_r_materialization_unit" kindref="compound">IRMaterializationUnit</ref> is a convenient base class for MaterializationUnits wrapping LLVM IR. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Represents materialization responsibility for all symbols in the given module. If symbols are overridden by other definitions, then their linkage is changed to available-externally. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
